(6128175, 902575, 114233, '<td valign="top">Simply brilliant for Minimal editing! I''m amazed the lights on the shore are not more blown with that length exposure. The exposure of the sky is perfect and composition draws my eye to the star trails then to the tree and back to the shore then to the stars again. MAGIC!</td>', 'Simply brilliant for Minimal editing! I''m amazed the lights on the shore are not more blown with that length exposure. The exposure of the sky is perfect and composition draws my eye to the star trails then to the tree and back to the shore then to the stars again. MAGIC!', '2010-08-12 11:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128233, 902486, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute pic, nice use of depth of field. Either your camera couldn''t compensate enough for the lighting, or you forgot about setting an appropriate white balance for the shot. I almost did that myself, but then remembered after I reviewed the first several on the screen.</td>', 'Cute pic, nice use of depth of field. Either your camera couldn''t compensate enough for the lighting, or you forgot about setting an appropriate white balance for the shot. I almost did that myself, but then remembered after I reviewed the first several on the screen.', '2010-08-12 13:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
