(6130686, 902704, 41211, '<td valign="top">Definitely my favourite image in this contest. I hope this places well!</td>', 'Definitely my favourite image in this contest. I hope this places well!', '2010-08-15 19:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130687, 902597, 41211, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting in this one!</td>', 'Love the lighting in this one!', '2010-08-15 19:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130689, 902932, 41211, '<td valign="top">neat concept! First saw your title entry and was expecting an image dealing with the earth. I like your concept better. I also like how you have the one lone bean straying from the pile. Creates a bit of interest. Hope this places well.</td>', 'neat concept! First saw your title entry and was expecting an image dealing with the earth. I like your concept better. I also like how you have the one lone bean straying from the pile. Creates a bit of interest. Hope this places well.', '2010-08-15 19:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130690, 901747, 41211, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo. Sat and stared at this one for a while! How did you get it looking neon like you did?</td>', 'Very cool photo. Sat and stared at this one for a while! How did you get it looking neon like you did?', '2010-08-15 19:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130691, 902387, 41211, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2010-08-15 19:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130693, 902682, 41211, '<td valign="top">Great Macro shot! Inspiring! Gots to get me a macro lens very soon!!!!</td>', 'Great Macro shot! Inspiring! Gots to get me a macro lens very soon!!!!', '2010-08-15 19:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130694, 902764, 41211, '<td valign="top">wow, I have had pet dogs in the past and kudos to you for being able to get yours to wear a costume and cape and give such a great pose! Hope it places well.</td>', 'wow, I have had pet dogs in the past and kudos to you for being able to get yours to wear a costume and cape and give such a great pose! Hope it places well.', '2010-08-15 19:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130695, 902635, 41211, '<td valign="top">beautiful image</td>', 'beautiful image', '2010-08-15 19:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130696, 902969, 41211, '<td valign="top">Just gorgeous. Love the colours!</td>', 'Just gorgeous. Love the colours!', '2010-08-15 19:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130697, 902865, 41211, '<td valign="top">very drastic lighting. I enjoy this image. Hope you do well in the competition.</td>', 'very drastic lighting. I enjoy this image. Hope you do well in the competition.', '2010-08-15 19:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130705, 902387, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent touch with the balloons in the background!</td>', 'Excellent touch with the balloons in the background!', '2010-08-15 19:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130706, 902668, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good illustration of the concept.  For something you''d want to submit for stock, you''d needto clean the table better first, maybe use clean shiny money, too.</td>', 'A good illustration of the concept.  For something you''d want to submit for stock, you''d needto clean the table better first, maybe use clean shiny money, too.', '2010-08-15 19:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130707, 902286, 30982, '<td valign="top">Outstanding job framing this in camera, and good job with the exposure as well.</td>', 'Outstanding job framing this in camera, and good job with the exposure as well.', '2010-08-15 19:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130708, 902914, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the motion blur.</td>', 'Nice job with the motion blur.', '2010-08-15 19:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130709, 901747, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting coloration - did you shoot this set to florescent light, maybe?  Title is a bit of a stretch, but that''s true for a lot of the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting coloration - did you shoot this set to florescent light, maybe?  Title is a bit of a stretch, but that''s true for a lot of the challenge.', '2010-08-15 19:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130711, 902895, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice canopy and pretty good job with the exposure.</td>', 'Nice canopy and pretty good job with the exposure.', '2010-08-15 19:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130712, 902960, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good job balancing out the exposure in this tricky light situation.</td>', 'Good job balancing out the exposure in this tricky light situation.', '2010-08-15 19:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130713, 902792, 30982, '<td valign="top">Underdeveloped and overexposed - to me it makes for a nice combination!</td>', 'Underdeveloped and overexposed - to me it makes for a nice combination!', '2010-08-15 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130714, 902635, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty impressive getting that top point right on the edge of the frame!</td>', 'Pretty impressive getting that top point right on the edge of the frame!', '2010-08-15 19:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130715, 902486, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that if you had the time to play with, you could try different white balances.  This one has that nice evening tungsten/sulfur hue to it.  Late days of summer kind of feel.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that if you had the time to play with, you could try different white balances.  This one has that nice evening tungsten/sulfur hue to it.  Late days of summer kind of feel.', '2010-08-15 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130716, 902580, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice find, good solid composition.  This also has some nice natural grunge to it without adding any Topaz.</td>', 'A nice find, good solid composition.  This also has some nice natural grunge to it without adding any Topaz.', '2010-08-15 19:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130718, 902969, 30982, '<td valign="top">VERY impressive exposure control to get this right.</td>', 'VERY impressive exposure control to get this right.', '2010-08-15 19:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130719, 902865, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''m keen on the amount of empty space above the head, but I do like the exposure control.</td>', 'Not sure I''m keen on the amount of empty space above the head, but I do like the exposure control.', '2010-08-15 19:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130720, 902733, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOVELY composition with the other flowering branch providing bokeh behind.</td>', 'LOVELY composition with the other flowering branch providing bokeh behind.', '2010-08-15 19:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130721, 902899, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent sentiment!  Pretty good job controling a tough exposure situation.</td>', 'Excellent sentiment!  Pretty good job controling a tough exposure situation.', '2010-08-15 19:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130722, 902889, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty good urban-style portrait!</td>', 'Pretty good urban-style portrait!', '2010-08-15 19:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130723, 902912, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Very amusing pose from your model!  A bit more light would be nice, and I''m sure you''d like a chance to edit this bring out her eyes, for instance.</td>', 'Heh!  Very amusing pose from your model!  A bit more light would be nice, and I''m sure you''d like a chance to edit this bring out her eyes, for instance.', '2010-08-15 19:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130746, 901984, 30982, '<td valign="top">Normally, one might not like the forward facing bird to be out of focus, or the neck on the left.  But somehow this works for me.</td>', 'Normally, one might not like the forward facing bird to be out of focus, or the neck on the left.  But somehow this works for me.', '2010-08-15 20:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130747, 902634, 30982, '<td valign="top">While this may not be some people''s idea of a great photograph, I think it''s pretty darn good.  The rainbow, the Winnebago, the flag, the dog - all perfect!</td>', 'While this may not be some people''s idea of a great photograph, I think it''s pretty darn good.  The rainbow, the Winnebago, the flag, the dog - all perfect!', '2010-08-15 20:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130748, 902590, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice long exposure and quite impressive the amount of detail inthe bridge you''ve captured.</td>', 'Very nice long exposure and quite impressive the amount of detail inthe bridge you''ve captured.', '2010-08-15 20:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130749, 902885, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very clever take on the challenge!  I like how the finger''s shadow falls over the name of the toy.  Good low-light capture and well exposed to get across the mood you''re creating.</td>', 'Very clever take on the challenge!  I like how the finger''s shadow falls over the name of the toy.  Good low-light capture and well exposed to get across the mood you''re creating.', '2010-08-15 20:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130750, 902955, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  And I''ll buy the title - works well for this shot!</td>', 'What a cutie!  And I''ll buy the title - works well for this shot!', '2010-08-15 20:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6130752, 902975, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do quite like the normalness of this.  Nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I do quite like the normalness of this.  Nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2010-08-15 20:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
