(6133437, 902964, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>Though 17th isn''t a bad finish, it is most definitely much lower than I expected it to be.  This, along with the blue ribbon winner were my highest rated images in the challenge (gave both 9).  Wonderfully composed image... beautifully balanced.  Great job... if only the voting masses would recognise the brilliance.  Rest assured that there are plenty of us that see it.  Well done.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  Though 17th isn''t a bad finish, it is most definitely much lower than I expected it to be.  This, along with the blue ribbon winner were my highest rated images in the challenge (gave both 9).  Wonderfully composed image... beautifully balanced.  Great job... if only the voting masses would recognise the brilliance.  Rest assured that there are plenty of us that see it.  Well done.', '2010-08-18 01:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6133445, 902764, 28359, '<td valign="top">So cool....Great expression he has....Big Congrats!</td>', 'So cool....Great expression he has....Big Congrats!', '2010-08-18 01:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
