(6133457, 902764, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first 7+ score and the red ribbon!  This was my pick of the litter, getting my only 10. ;)</td>', 'Congrats on your first 7+ score and the red ribbon!  This was my pick of the litter, getting my only 10. ;)', '2010-08-18 01:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
