(6133506, 902575, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, I was only about 30 miles away, on Lake Groton, VT!  Funny we both entered star trail shots using the same lens!  When I saw yours, I thought "that''s what mine should''ve been."<br/> <br/>Does your camera not get hazy spots along the edge from sensor heating?<br/> <br/>Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'Hey, I was only about 30 miles away, on Lake Groton, VT!  Funny we both entered star trail shots using the same lens!  When I saw yours, I thought "that''s what mine should''ve been." Does your camera not get hazy spots along the edge from sensor heating? Congrats on top 10!', '2010-08-18 02:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6133507, 902286, 60862, '<td valign="top">I thought this was beautiful.  Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'I thought this was beautiful.  Congrats on top 10!', '2010-08-18 02:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
