(6133517, 902569, 60862, '<td valign="top">What a shame.  Please spend time reading the rules, because I loved this photo, and I look forward to more!<br/> <br/>And I disagree with giantmike that the people are a problem.  I think they really show the scale.  If you weren''t familiar with the Eiffel Tower, they show how huge it is.  To say nothing of how impossible it''d be to get rid of the people.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-18 01:17:48.</i></td>', 'What a shame.  Please spend time reading the rules, because I loved this photo, and I look forward to more! And I disagree with giantmike that the people are a problem.  I think they really show the scale.  If you weren''t familiar with the Eiffel Tower, they show how huge it is.  To say nothing of how impossible it''d be to get rid of the people.', '2010-08-18 02:16:17.000000', '2010-08-18 02:17:48.000000', 0),
