(6138852, 902575, 5885, '<td valign="top">Greetings from Critique Club:<br/> <br/>First Impression: What can I say, star trail images are beautiful. With all our modern technology, contemporary society often neglects the beauty above our heads. When we see a well-executed photo like this, we are sent back to a time when we depended on the stars for many aspects of our existence.<br/> <br/>Technicals:<br/>I can''t say there is anything I''d change about this image. It''s technically sound straight from the camera. A very well-executed image.<br/> <br/>Artistically:<br/>I enjoy your composition and use of framing devices. Although, some of the lights on the horizon are a bit distracting. <br/> <br/>How to grow it''s vote:<br/>I can''t say I can give you any ideas on that. It''s well executed, fits the challenge. Has a bit of "wow factor", the rest is up to the voters. <br/> <br/>In closing, I really enjoyed your photo and am glad it was put in front of me to critique. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Greetings from Critique Club: First Impression: What can I say, star trail images are beautiful. With all our modern technology, contemporary society often neglects the beauty above our heads. When we see a well-executed photo like this, we are sent back to a time when we depended on the stars for many aspects of our existence. Technicals:I can''t say there is anything I''d change about this image. It''s technically sound straight from the camera. A very well-executed image. Artistically:I enjoy your composition and use of framing devices. Although, some of the lights on the horizon are a bit distracting.  How to grow it''s vote:I can''t say I can give you any ideas on that. It''s well executed, fits the challenge. Has a bit of "wow factor", the rest is up to the voters.  In closing, I really enjoyed your photo and am glad it was put in front of me to critique. Keep up the good work.', '2010-08-23 16:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6138920, 901886, 5885, '<td valign="top">Greetings from Critique Club:<br/> <br/>Let me introduce myself. My name is Leroy Dickson, I''m a professional photographer, specializing in glamour, fashion and nude photography. But, I enjoy all forms of photography and appreciate the artistic efforts of all.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>Nice composition. A good shot of a beautiful Cathedral. <br/> <br/>Technicals:<br/>I feel the image is a tad over-exposed, leaving the photo a bit flat. Seeing the shadows are coming straight down, Idefinitely think it could have been better shot at a different time of day.<br/> <br/>Artistic:<br/>Composition is ok. I will second my opinion on being a better shot in better light.<br/> <br/>How to grow its vote:<br/>It really doesn''t have much Wow to it. It''s a great tourist photo, but doesn''t quite have the umph needed to get top votes here. Some may have also seen it as not fitting the challenge.<br/> <br/>In closing:<br/>Looking at the rest of your work, I''d definitely love to see a processed version of this image.</td>', 'Greetings from Critique Club: Let me introduce myself. My name is Leroy Dickson, I''m a professional photographer, specializing in glamour, fashion and nude photography. But, I enjoy all forms of photography and appreciate the artistic efforts of all. First Impression:Nice composition. A good shot of a beautiful Cathedral.  Technicals:I feel the image is a tad over-exposed, leaving the photo a bit flat. Seeing the shadows are coming straight down, Idefinitely think it could have been better shot at a different time of day. Artistic:Composition is ok. I will second my opinion on being a better shot in better light. How to grow its vote:It really doesn''t have much Wow to it. It''s a great tourist photo, but doesn''t quite have the umph needed to get top votes here. Some may have also seen it as not fitting the challenge. In closing:Looking at the rest of your work, I''d definitely love to see a processed version of this image.', '2010-08-23 18:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
